{"ref":"BDB, יְהָב","hw":"יְהָב","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">יְהָב</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>lot (</strong>what is <em>given</em><strong>)</strong>? cf. 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">יַהֲבַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:6\" href=\"/Psalms.11.6\">ψ 11:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהָבִית</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:10\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.10\">Ec 5:10</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">הַשְׁלֵךְ עַל י׳ יְהָֽבְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:23\" href=\"/Psalms.55.23\">ψ 55:23</a> <em>cast on</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>thy lot</em> (the care, anxiety, etc. which are thy portion; cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גּוֹל עַל־י׳ דרכך</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:5\" href=\"/Psalms.37.5\">ψ 37:5</a>).","next":"BDB, הַבְהָב","prev":"BDB, יָהַב"}